Spec: Measure Tool

Purpose:
  Allow users to measure distances between two points on the canvas
  without creating permanent geometry.

Owns:
  ./measure.ts
  ./measure.test.ts

Must:
  Activate via toolbar button or keyboard shortcut (M).
  First click sets the start point.
  Mouse move shows a live measurement line with distance in mm.
  Second click sets the end point and displays final measurement.
  Display distance, delta X, and delta Y in mm.
  Measurement overlay renders above all shapes.
  Snapping applies to measurement endpoints when enabled.
  Pressing Escape cancels the current measurement.
  Measurements are temporary (not saved to project).

Must not:
  Create shapes or modify the document.
  Persist measurements in the store or project file.
  Block other tools from being selected (measurement clears on tool change).

Depends on:
  @BaseTool
  @IEditorContext
  @SnapManager
  @PIXELS_PER_MM

Exposes:
  MeasureTool (extends BaseTool)

Scenario: measure distance between two points
  Given the Measure tool is active
  When the user clicks at (100mm, 50mm) and then at (200mm, 50mm)
  Then the overlay displays "100.00 mm"
  And delta X shows "100.00 mm" and delta Y shows "0.00 mm"

Scenario: snap to endpoint while measuring
  Given snapping is enabled and a shape has an endpoint at (75mm, 30mm)
  When the user moves the cursor near (75mm, 30mm)
  Then the measurement start snaps to exactly (75mm, 30mm)
  And a snap indicator appears

Scenario: cancel measurement
  Given the user has placed the start point
  When the user presses Escape
  Then the measurement overlay is cleared
  And the tool returns to awaiting first click

Tasks:
  [ ] Create MeasureTool class extending BaseTool.
  [ ] Implement two-click measurement flow.
  [ ] Render measurement line overlay (dashed line with arrowheads).
  [ ] Display distance label at midpoint of measurement line.
  [ ] Display delta X and delta Y in a small tooltip.
  [ ] Integrate with SnapManager for endpoint snapping.
  [ ] Add "M" keyboard shortcut to shortcuts.ts.
  [ ] Add Measure button to toolbar.
  [ ] Add unit test for distance calculation.

Done when:
  Two-click measurement displays correct distance in mm.
  Snap works on measurement endpoints.
  Escape cancels cleanly.
  No shapes are created or modified.
  Shortcut "M" activates the tool.
